        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "35-4-3 A teacher will be paid for accumulated personal leave days, upon retirement, at the same rate as sick leave reimbursement; or the teacher may use accumulated personal leave as outlined in Sections 35-42-3-1 and 35-4-3-2.",
