        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "35-6-1 Permanent teachers will be granted up to five (5) days' bereavement leave, which may be deducted from either personal leave or accrued sick leave, in the event of death of any member of the immediate family. The teacher involved will determine whether the days are deducted from personal or sick leave.",
